  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now integrating both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;so putting the value in above equation we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the equation becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now finding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;so putting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;in above equation we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
